abstract: "Public repository of the AI4WasteRecognition project. It publishes two 24 GHz FMCW radar datasets of sorted waste collected in the project laboratory experiments, a video segmentation dataset of sorted waste (322 images, 7,124 instances), dataset documentation, and export and training code."
